# Initialisms: kept in the Preferred tier, never inflected. Passed to
# theme_expand.py --literal, which exempts them from generation. MUNI, VUT and JAMU
# all have MorfFlex paradigms, so without this MUNI declines to MUNU.
bvv;260
ceitec;260
dpmb;260
ičo;220
ids;260
jamu;260
mhd;260
mmb;260
moú;260
muni;260
mzlu;260
paro;260
psč;220
sako;220
tic;260
vida;240
vut;260
zuš;240
ztp;220
úmč;240
# Lexicalised idiom forms (CLUES.md sec. 8, IDIOM hook). They live in one fixed
# shape inside a set phrase -- "a je to v cudu", "konec, slus" -- so the rest of the
# paradigm is not Czech anyone says.
brna;260
čudu;260
eště;220
fuč;240
šlus;240
štatl;260
# Street names that do not decline in use, or that lemmatise to the wrong place.
# "na Orli", "na Veveri" are fixed; Lisen analyses to both Lisen_;G and Lisno_;G, and
# generating from the second produces `lisna`, which is a different village.
orlí;240
veveří;240
líšeň;240
líšně;240
